    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already checked my sugar and it's just a little higher than usual, nothing crazy. i'm pretty sure it's just the supplement making me retain water or something. do you think it's possible the biotin and chromium are just messing with my hydration levels? i don't really want to go to the doctor if it's just a minor side effect from the vitamins.",
